-- holler (link 24 / native-codegen Link 40) KERNEL emit mode: the geeking kernel + a do_write (SYS_WRITE,
-- int 0x30 eax=2) arm -- the FIRST confused-deputy kernel-contract surface. Machine-generated from
-- holler_ref.py (do not hand-edit). HEAD-portion is hex-data with esp_top substitution at the 10 holler
-- offsets; the PD+PT identity map REUSES geeking's loops (identical -- no dup, avoids a cloggard anchor
-- collision). Output == holler_ref.build_code prefix; prefix_len 24564 (the do_write arm was absorbed by the
-- align-pad before the page-aligned PD/PT, so it is byte-identical in length to geeking/sitopia).
func nc32_holler_data():
    return ""
